+WRITER'S INTENT: {intent or '(none given)'}
+SUBTOPICS THE ARTICLE WILL COVER: {"; ".join(subtopics) or "(none)"}
+QUESTIONS READERS ASK: {"; ".join(questions) or "(none)"}
+{date_context()}"""
